      "fill": "teal",
      "text": "Step 4 changes (for your review)\n\n1 · Where & when: arrival time on the first day, leaving time on the last day, and where from / how (moved here).\n\n2 · Your style: 'Your day' (start around · finish by) replaces typed times and 'max per day'. 'Build my plan now' skips step 3.\n\n3 · Your must-dos (new): must-sees with a day and a time, busy times, places to skip, avoid crowds, and a summary.\n\nBuilding: if a must-see can't fit, you choose what happens. Nothing is dropped silently.\n\nIn the app (not shown here): rows glide when the order changes."
